2026-10-30T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2343) 'The first version of this rung promised a shared world, a wardrobe, the mascot's requests and the signs. None of them is built.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:05Z (RFD66606-2343) 'Run the proof in RFD66606-2344 against each dev.2 claim: the XR pen, the closed shell, the dress-on statue, world grab and the station walker.
 # tags: rfd:exit
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:06Z (RFD66606-2343) 'dev.2, what the pen holds at its pinned commit
 # tags: rfd:details-title, rfd:no-final-newline
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:07Z (RFD66606-2343) 'dev.2 is what the pen holds at its pinned commit, written down and nothing more. A person draws with the XR pen, curvenet.elf closes the strokes into one shell, and the shell shows on the dress-on statue. World grab and the station walker work. RFD66606-2344 proves each of these under the private working agreements.
 # tags: rfd:decision
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

