2026-10-30T00:00:11Z (RFD66606-2343) 'What dev.2 holds
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:12Z (RFD66606-2343) 'Each line names the gate in the pen's `tools/` that already exercises it.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:13Z (RFD66606-2343) '- The scripted pen in `xr_main.tscn`, XR or flat: 6 strokes close 2 cycles and 2 openings into one skirt shell (`gate_xr_scripted.gd`).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:14Z (RFD66606-2343) '- A recorded or replayed stroke layer, through OXRSys or from `.usda`, meshed to its expected counts; a CASSIE session replayed to every expected cycle (`gate_replay.gd`).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:15Z (RFD66606-2343) '- The dress-on statue beside the plaza monument: the skirt drawn at the statue lands in its body frame and shows on it as a closed garment (`gate_statue.gd`).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:16Z (RFD66606-2343) '- World grab: both grips carry, turn and scale the canvas; one grip moves nothing (`gate_world_grab.gd`).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:17Z (RFD66606-2343) '- The walker on the station's colliders in the MuJoCo guest: walk, stairs, ledge and handrail refusal, snap turn, teleport, bit-exact repeat (`gate_locomotion.gd`).
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:18Z (RFD66606-2343) '- Pen strokes drawn as Line3D ribbons; every shipped guest and `.sgd` binary-translated on macOS and Windows.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:19Z (RFD66606-2343) '- The tray from RFD66606-2342: icon, popup, headset probe, the mascot idling.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:20Z (RFD66606-2343) 'What dev.2 does not hold
 # tags: rfd:details-heading
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

2026-10-30T00:00:21Z (RFD66606-2343) 'Every gate above stops at MESH. Nothing checks a garment against a body mesh, a clothing hide, or bone rest scale. No SCSS port is in the pen. No zone, no ENet clients, no FDB-SQLite wardrobe, no mascot requests, no signs, no audio cues. These wait in RFD66606-2341.
 # tags: rfd:details
 Text:RFD2343  1 LINE
 Text:Written

